s Konto freizuschalten.\n      <\/p>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <!-- Step 3 -->\n    <div class=\"step-box\">\n      <div class=\"step-icon\">\n        <!-- Discount Icon -->\n        <svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1f1f1f\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\">\n          <path d=\"M20 12V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14l4-4h11a2 2 0 0 0 2-2z\"><\/path>\n        <\/svg>\n      <\/div>\n      <h3>Schritt 3<\/h3>\n      <h4>Exklusive Rabatte erhalten<\/h4>\n      <p>Sobald Ihr Konto verifiziert ist, können Sie einkaufen. Basierend auf Ihrem Bestellvolumen und -wert stellen wir Ihnen exklusive Rabattcodes für zukünftige Einkäufe zur Verfügung.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<style>\n  .steps-section {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 60px 20px;\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"Inter\", sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .steps-section h2 {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n    color: #111111;\n  }\n\n  .steps-container {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 80px;\n    max-width: 1600px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .step-box {\n    background: #f8f8f8;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n    flex: 1 1 300px;\n    max-width: 340px;\n    padding: 30px 20px;\n    transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;\n  }\n\n  .step-box:hover {\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\n  }\n\n  .step-icon {\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .step-box h3 {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    color: #1f1f1f;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .step-box h4 {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #2e2e2e;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .step-box p {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #3a3a3a;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n\n  \/* Default links (non-WhatsApp) *\/\n  .step-box a {\n    color: #1f1f1f;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n\n  \/* ✅ WhatsApp link color *\/\n  .step-box .whatsapp-link {\n    color: #25d366;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  .step-box .whatsapp-link:hover {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .steps-section h2 {\n      font-size: 22px;\n    }\n    .step-box {\n      max-width: 100%;\n    }\n  }\n<\/style>","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"reset_spacing":true}},"custom_html_zGKpMU":{"type":"custom-html","name":"t:sections.custom-html.name","settings":{"heading_logo_svg":"","subheading":"","heading":"","description":"","text_alignment":"text-center","container":"container","color_scheme":"","content_html":"<!-- WhatsApp Chat Button -->\n<div class=\"cta\">\n  <a href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/4915755925255?text=Hallo%20ICH%20bin%20interessiert.\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"chat-btn\">\n    <img src=\"https:\/\/upload.wikimedia.org\/wikipedia\/commons\/6\/6b\/WhatsApp.svg\" alt=\"WhatsApp\" class=\"whatsapp-icon\">\n    Jetzt chatten\n  <\/a>\n<\/div>\n\n<style>\n  .cta {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .chat-btn {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background-color: #25d366;\n    color: white;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    padding: 12px 26px;\n    border-radius: 40px;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: background 0.3s ease;\n    box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.25);\n  }\n\n  .chat-btn:hover {\n    background-color: #1ebe5d;\n  }\n\n  .whatsapp-icon {\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .chat-btn {\n      padding: 10px 22px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n  }\n<\/style>","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":28,"reset_spacing":true}},"banner_with_text_y634PL":{"type":"banner-with-text","blocks":{"heading_